essbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A process for the preparation of 4-substituted benzopyran derivatives which comprises preparing N-(2-cyanoethyl)-5-fluoro-4-fluoromethyl-4-(4-trifluoromethylphenoxy)-2-pentynamide from 1-fluoro-2-fluoromethyl-3-butyn-2-yl 4-trifluoromethylphenyl ether and cyclizing this pentynamide derivative into 2,2-bis(fluoromethyl)-N-(2-cyanoethyl)-6-trifluoromethyl-2H-1-benzopyran-4-carboxamide; and other processes therefor. The processes make it possible to prepare the benzopyran derivatives in a shortened process time as compared with those of the prior art with high safety through easy purification.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de préparation de dérivés de benzopyranne 4-substitué, consistant à préparer le N-(2-cyanoéthyl)-5-fluoro-4-fluorométhyl-4-(4-trifluorométhylphénoxy)-2-pentynamide à partir du 1-fluoro-2-fluorométhyl-3-butyne-2-yl 4-trifluorométhylphényl éther et à cycliser ces dérivés de pentynamide en 2,2-bis(fluorométhyl)-N-(2-cyanoéthyl)-6-trifluorométhyl-2H-1-benzopyranne-4-carboxamide. L'invention concerne également d'autres procédés de préparation de tels dérivés. Les procédés selon l'invention permettent de préparer les dérivés du benzopyranne en un temps plus court que pour les procédés de la technique connue, avec une haute sécurité en raison de la facilité de la purification.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>